'''3.''' Composed largely of sand or sandy particles. {{smaller|(''a'') In ''geol.'', applied to rocks: as, ''arenaceous'' limestone. A rock is said to be ''arenaceous'' when it contains a considerable amount of quartz-sand, or is largely made up of sandy particles.}}
